<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal's June inflation figures July 14 - INE.</title>
<headline>Portugal's June inflation figures July 14 - INE.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portugal's National Statistics Institute will release the consumer price index (CPI) for June on July 14, a spokesman told Reuters.</p>
<p>A recent Reuter poll of analysts saw a month-on-month rate of between minus 0.1 percent and plus 0.3 to give a year-on-year rise of between 2.0 and 2.4 percent.</p>
<p>In May, the month-on-month rise was 0.7 percent and the year-on-year rate 2.1 percent.</p>
<p>--Lisbon bureau 3511-3150035</p>
</text>
